{"product":{"id":8960554074388,"title":"ENGINEERING SERVICES TO THE LOCALS IN ALL THE CITIES","body_html":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eFuture Cites for engineering consultations is an approved office and holds regular licenses from government agencies and institutions to provide public services to citizens and residents in all cities of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, such as (Baladi platform services, collective and individual housing portal for labor, Ihkam platform, real estate screening portal for housing and agricultural units, Najis portal) .\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eIt is also possible to benefit from all engineering services to the public by visiting our branches located in the Kingdom, or by telephone and applying remotely in any city in the Kingdom.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eDesign and building permits:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eArchitectural and engineering design by preparing and producing all types of plans (architectural – construction – electrical – mechanical “feed – drainage” – air conditioning – special and smart systems).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cspan s